    historicalInfo: "Casa Batll\xF3 was originally built in 1877 by Emili Sala Cort\xE9s, one of Gaud\xED's architecture teachers. In 1904, Josep Batll\xF3 commissioned Gaud\xED to renovate the building. Gaud\xED completely transformed the building between 1904 and 1906. In 2005, Casa Batll\xF3 was designated a UNESCO World Heritage Site along with other works by Gaud\xED.",
